							<summary type="html"><![CDATA[The company showed off the Y50 RGB during Computex 2026, which costs just $99.99. It supports an array of motherboard sizes and comes with the same three-piece panoramic glass as the pricier Y70. Hyte is just one of the PC component makers grappling with the effects of the RAM crunch, and is likely launching this [&#8230;]]]></summary>
			
							<content type="html">
